   375	                "verdict-fields, and the\n"
   376	                "      re-pass artifacts — nothing else. Allowlisting a "
   377	                "version site, a\n"
   378	                "      workflow or any code path turns this assert into "
   379	                "permission to land\n"
   380	                "      unreviewed work on the tag, which is the hole it "
   381	                "exists to close."
   382	                % (entry, EVIDENCE_PREFIX),
